result: FAIL
After 3 workers were killed by this job, its attempt count is still 0.
Reclaim after a lost reservation preserves attempts, so a job that crashes
its worker is never dead-lettered: it kills each worker that claims it, is
reclaimed unchanged, and kills the next one. A deployment that restarts
workers automatically will do this forever.
